WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.920
Your providers, staff and vendors change.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.750
So do the exclusion lists.

3
00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.620
Spot checks leave gaps.

4
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:12.330
IntegrityShield Healthcare SES screens your providers, staff, contractors and vendors,

5
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:16.240
against OIG, state Medicaid, SAM and OFAC lists,

6
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.450
and again whenever a list changes.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:24.130
Identity matching checks NPI, date of birth and address, and alerts you to possible matches.

8
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.200
Your compliance reviewer decides:

9
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:26.840
clear it,

10
00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:27.710
or confirm it.

11
00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.990
Confirmed matches are tracked to closure,

12
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.570
every decision on record.

13
00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.090
IntegrityShield Healthcare SES.

14
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:35.040
Book a demo.
